  "description": "Catalogue data for the information gain visualizer. The page does not fetch this file: the same Kent scale, survey answers, examples, units, limits and wording thresholds are inlined in index.html, and a test keeps them equal. Kent is a proposed reference scale; the survey is every individual answer as published (probly.csv, MIT licence, see LICENSE). Example probabilities are illustrative, not measurements.",
